# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 全仓通用：本地状态、缓存、虚拟环境、凭据、二进制与媒体
# 模块专有规则见各模块小节；模块自带的 .gitignore 优先级更高。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Local agent state, environments and caches
.omx/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.cache/
.runtime_config/
.DS_Store

# Private configuration, credentials and personal application documents
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
*token*.txt
/docs/qin.png
/docs/zhitaowang.png
/scannetpp-terms-of-use*.pdf

# Datasets, checkpoints, inference artifacts (restore from private storage)
/weights/
**/weights/
**/checkpoints/
**/onnx_models/
**/outputs/
**/inputs/

# Binary model / geometry / dataset payloads, including future additions
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.engine
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.bin
*.npy
*.npz
*.ply
*.pcd
*.sens
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.parquet
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
*.so
*.o
*.a

# Images, videos, paper PDFs, logs: stored separately, not source code
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.pdf
*.log


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# InstanceRecognition
# 另见 InstanceRecognition/.gitignore：artifacts/ site/ pagegen/templates/ tmp/ .venv/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/InstanceRecognition/runtime/*
!/InstanceRecognition/runtime/offline/
/InstanceRecognition/runtime/offline/data.js
# Page data is rebuilt by pagegen; the generator and its templates are tracked
/InstanceRecognition/docs/assets/**/data.js
# Session transcript exports are not source
/InstanceRecognition/*session-is-being-continued*.txt


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Video2PointCloud
# 三方仓已统一到根 Submodule/（amb3r / depth-anything-3 / map-anything /
# pytorch3d / utils3d），本目录只留集成代码。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Video2PointCloud/data/
/Video2PointCloud/output/*
!/Video2PointCloud/output/README.md
!/Video2PointCloud/output/reports/


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ObjectGeneration
# 进库：src/ tests/ scripts/ pagegen/ configs/ docs/*.md docs/**/*.json
#       根级 README.md、constraints-sam3d.txt、third_party_patches/*.patch
# 不进库：运行产物、虚拟环境、三方 checkout、渲染出的 HTML 页面
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/ObjectGeneration/output/
/ObjectGeneration/site/
/ObjectGeneration/tmp/
/ObjectGeneration/.venv-*/
# 页面由 pagegen 重建，本机留档即可；docs/ 下的 .md 和 .json 仍然跟踪
/ObjectGeneration/docs/**/*.html
# /ObjectGeneration/ThirdParty/ 已废弃：三方仓统一到根 Submodule/，规则一并删除


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SceneAssembly
# runs/ 由 SceneAssembly/.gitignore 挡住；src/inputs/ 是 M0 源码，
# 在模块自己的 .gitignore 里解封了根规则 **/inputs/。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ScanNet
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/ScanNet/assets/


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 共享文档与页面
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/assets/*
# Keep viewer source; generated scene data and recorded API payloads stay local.
!/docs/assets/global-object-bboxes/
/docs/assets/global-object-bboxes/*
!/docs/assets/global-object-bboxes/build_bboxes.py
!/docs/assets/global-object-bboxes/style.css
!/docs/assets/global-object-bboxes/viewer.js
!/docs/assets/harness-tools/
/docs/assets/harness-tools/*
!/docs/assets/harness-tools/page.css

# Shared experiment navigation source (not recorded run data)
!/docs/assets/experiment-navigation.js
!/docs/assets/experiment-navigation.css

# Repo-level scratch space
/tmp/
